---
const RESUME_PATH = "/resume.pdf";
---

<section id="about" class="py-16 sm:py-24 border-b border-[var(--color-border)] space-y-12">
  <div class="max-w-2xl space-y-3">
    <div class="text-label text-[var(--color-accent-text)] font-mono tracking-widest">
      BIOGRAPHY &amp; ACADEMICS
    </div>
    <h2 class="text-h1 font-bold text-[var(--color-text-primary)] tracking-tight">
      About Me
    </h2>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 lg:gap-12 items-start">
    <!-- Narrative Body Paragraphs (7 Columns on Desktop) -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-5 text-body text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        I am <strong class="text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">Ajayi Enitan Fiyinfoluwa</strong>, a passionate <strong class="text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">Frontend &amp; Web Developer</strong> based in Lagos, Nigeria. I bridge the space between design creativity and technical execution to build clean, intuitive, and responsive web products.
      </p>

      <p>
        My technical foundation centers on <strong class="text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript, React, Bootstrap</strong>, and full-stack integration with <strong class="text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">PHP, MySQL, and REST APIs</strong>. I take pride in writing modular, readable code, architecting accessible user journeys, and translating visual mockups from Canva and Figma into live digital experiences.
      </p>

      <p>
        I define my work through three principles: being <span class="font-medium text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">creative and innovative</span> in UI design, <span class="font-medium text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">professional and reliable</span> in communication and delivery, and <span class="font-medium text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">technical and detail-oriented</span> in code structure and performance.
      </p>

      <p>
        Currently, I am actively seeking full-time and remote frontend engineering roles or impactful web development projects where I can contribute fresh energy, collaborate with engineering teams, and build products users love.
      </p>

      <div class="pt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a 
          href={RESUME_PATH}
          target="_blank"
          download="Ajayi_Enitan_Fiyinfoluwa_Resume.pdf"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-[var(--radius-sm)] border border-[var(--color-border)] bg-[var(--color-surface)] px-4 py-2 font-medium text-small text-[var(--color-text-primary)] hover:border-[var(--color-accent)] hover:text-[var(--color-accent-text)] transition-colors"
        >
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-4 w-4 text-[var(--color-accent-text)]" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4 16v1a3 3 0 003 3h10a3 3 0 003-3v-1m-4-4l-4 4m0 0l-4-4m4 4V4" />
          </svg>
          Download Official CV
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Education & Academic Achievements (5 Columns on Desktop) -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-6">
      <!-- Education Card -->
      <div class="rounded-[var(--radius-md)] border border-[var(--color-border)] bg-[var(--color-surface)] p-6 space-y-4">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5 text-[var(--color-accent-text)]" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 14l9-5-9-5-9 5 9 5z"></path>
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 14l6.16-3.422a12.083 12.083 0 01.665 6.479A11.952 11.952 0 0112 20.055a11.952 11.952 0 01-6.824-2.998 12.078 12.078 0 01.665-6.479L12 14z"></path>
          </svg>
          <h3 class="text-h3 font-bold text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">Education</h3>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-2 border-t border-[var(--color-border)]/60 pt-3">
          <h4 class="text-small font-bold text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">B.Sc. in Computer Science</h4>
          <div class="text-meta text-[var(--color-accent-text)] font-mono">University Degree Program · Lagos, Nigeria</div>
          <div class="text-meta text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] font-mono">Graduating Class of 2026</div>
          <div class="pt-1">
            <span class="rounded-[var(--radius-sm)] border border-[var(--color-border)] bg-[var(--color-background)] px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-mono text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">
              Second Class Upper Honors
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Academic Achievements Card -->
      <div class="rounded-[var(--radius-md)] border border-[var(--color-border)] bg-[var(--color-surface)] p-6 space-y-4">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5 text-[var(--color-accent-text)]" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4M7.835 4.697a3.42 3.42 0 001.946-.806 3.42 3.42 0 014.438 0 3.42 3.42 0 001.946.806 3.42 3.42 0 013.138 3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00.806 1.946 3.42 3.42 0 010 4.438 3.42 3.42 0 00-.806 1.946 3.42 3.42 0 01-3.138 3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00-1.946.806 3.42 3.42 0 01-4.438 0 3.42 3.42 0 00-1.946-.806 3.42 3.42 0 01-3.138-3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00-.806-1.946 3.42 3.42 0 010-4.438 3.42 3.42 0 00.806-1.946 3.42 3.42 0 013.138-3.138z" />
          </svg>
          <h3 class="text-h3 font-bold text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">Academic Achievements</h3>
        </div>

        <ul class="space-y-3 border-t border-[var(--color-border)]/60 pt-3 text-small text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] list-none p-0 m-0">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="text-[var(--color-accent-text)] font-mono font-bold mt-0.5">✦</span>
            <span><strong class="text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">Excellence in Web Systems &amp; Software Design:</strong> Recognized for top-tier coursework performance in database design and client-side computing.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="text-[var(--color-accent-text)] font-mono font-bold mt-0.5">✦</span>
            <span><strong class="text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">Capstone Project Distinction:</strong> Engineered a full-featured web platform with complete user authentication and responsive layout.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="text-[var(--color-accent-text)] font-mono font-bold mt-0.5">✦</span>
            <span><strong class="text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">Mentorship Leadership:</strong> Organized peer tutorial sessions helping fellow students master HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and Git fundamentals.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
